====================================================================================================
SEED-TO-SEED DISPERSION ANALYSIS (spread = max-min over 3 seeds per cell)
====================================================================================================
CAVEAT: runs are seeded but GPU reductions are nondeterministic, so seed spread includes batch-order and hardware noise, not init variance alone.
Covers EVERY response this family's location analysis F-tests (decision 2026-09-11, extending the 2026-08-26 transmission-only decision), plus best_epoch when the epoch cache is available. ci_interior_total is descriptive-only in the location analysis and is therefore not a dispersion response either. Raw scale only -- pooled into its own BH family per model family, separate from the location BH families above (different n, different power: not comparable across analyses).
